-- הסכם קיבוצי כללי ליישום רפורמת "עוז לתמורה" בחטיבות העליונות (14.8.2011)
-- — the vocabulary its sections share. Only what more than one section
-- uses lives here; a section's own terms live in its own file, beside the
-- clause that coins them.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties

§ `הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011) — אוצר מילים משותף`

-- The school years the agreement names, each by the calendar year in which
-- it opens on 1 September (convention dates.school-year): תשע"ב is the year
-- from 1.9.2011.
`the school year 5772` MEANS 2011
`the school year 5773` MEANS 2012
`the school year 5774` MEANS 2013
`the school year 5775` MEANS 2014

-- Whether school year y (by the calendar year it opens in) is one of the
-- years from `first` to `last`, both of them in.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, first IS A NUMBER, last IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school year` y `is from` first `to` last IF
    y AT LEAST first AND y AT MOST last

-- How far the reform reaches, in a school in a school year (§5(א)) or in
-- the terms a teaching employee is employed on (§§6–8): in full, in part
-- (part ז, in the school years תשע"ב–תשע"ד), or not at all.
DECLARE `extent of the Oz reform` IS ONE OF
    `the Oz reform in full`
    `the Oz reform in part`
    `off the Oz reform`

-- What §§6(ב) and 7(ח) ask of a teaching employee before the reform may
-- reach him, and §5(ב) and §8(ב)(1) through them.
@desc A teaching employee's position and qualifications, as §§6(ב) and 7(ח) ask.
DECLARE `Oz teaching employee's qualifications` HAS
    `position share with the employers, in all` IS A NUMBER  @desc with all the employers together (אצל המעסיקים, במצטבר); 1 is a full position
    `entitled to a permanent teaching licence or a licence to teach` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds an academic degree` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaches a field with no relevant academic education, with a permit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teaching permit given by the Ministry's instructions
    `holds technological education relevant to the field taught` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN q IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `holds a licence and a degree` q IF
    q's `entitled to a permanent teaching licence or a licence to teach` AND q's `holds an academic degree`

GIVEN q IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed below a third of a position` q IF
    q's `position share with the employers, in all` LESS THAN 1/3

-- The three kinds of hour the Oz work week is made of (§9(ו)).
@desc A teacher's weekly hours in the school under the Oz reform.
DECLARE `Oz work week` HAS
    `frontal teaching hours`       IS A NUMBER @desc in front of a class; role hours that replace them count here (§10(א))
    `individual hours with pupils` IS A NUMBER @desc with a group of up to 3 pupils, or up to 5 (§9(ו)(2))
    `teaching-support hours`       IS A NUMBER @desc in the school, on the work §9(ו)(3) lists

GIVEN w IS A `Oz work week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours of the Oz week` w IS
    w's `frontal teaching hours` PLUS w's `individual hours with pupils` PLUS w's `teaching-support hours`

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, i IS A NUMBER, s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Oz work week`
DECIDE `an Oz week of` f i s IS
    `Oz work week` WITH
        `frontal teaching hours`       IS f
        `individual hours with pupils` IS i
        `teaching-support hours`       IS s

-- The roles part ד pays and counts, in §17's table's order: סגן מנהל
-- בית ספר, רכז שכבה (י'–י"ב, and ט' in a four-year school), רכז חינוך
-- חברתי, רכז התאמות ללמידה והיבחנות בבחינות הבגרות, רכז מקצוע, רכז מדידה
-- והערכה, מחנך כיתה, יועץ חינוכי, the teacher the principal gives tasks;
-- then רכז טיולים, which §20 adds; any other role a teacher may be given is
-- `another Oz role` (§17(ב)).
@desc A role a teacher under the Oz reform may hold, as §§17 and 20 name them.
DECLARE `Oz role` IS ONE OF
    `the Oz deputy principal`
    `the Oz grade coordinator`
    `the Oz social-education coordinator`
    `the Oz adjustments coordinator`
    `the Oz subject coordinator`
    `the Oz measurement and evaluation coordinator`
    `the Oz homeroom teacher`
    `the Oz educational counsellor`
    `the Oz teacher with tasks the principal assigns`
    `the Oz trips coordinator`
    `another Oz role`

-- What a salary component is "brought into account" for (§16(ב), §20(ז),
-- and §§38(ג), 39(ב)): the hour value, severance pay under the Severance
-- Pay Law, contributions to a pension provident fund, to a training fund
-- and to the Dafna fund, and computing a percentage supplement on the
-- combined salary — the agreement's own supplements by name, the rest
-- (role allowances among them) together.
DECLARE `what an Oz salary component counts for` IS ONE OF
    `computing the hour value`
    `Oz severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`
    `contributions to a pension provident fund`
    `contributions to a training fund`
    `contributions to the Dafna fund`
    `computing supplement 2001`
    `computing supplement 2008`
    `computing supplement 2011`
    `computing erosion supplement 2011`
    `computing the promotion-grade supplement`
    `computing another percentage supplement on the combined salary`

`what an Oz salary component may count for` MEANS
    LIST `computing the hour value`, `Oz severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`, `contributions to a pension provident fund`, `contributions to a training fund`, `contributions to the Dafna fund`, `computing supplement 2001`, `computing supplement 2008`, `computing supplement 2011`, `computing erosion supplement 2011`, `computing the promotion-grade supplement`, `computing another percentage supplement on the combined salary`

GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `computing a percentage supplement` p IF
        p EQUALS `computing supplement 2001`
    OR p EQUALS `computing supplement 2008`
    OR p EQUALS `computing supplement 2011`
    OR p EQUALS `computing erosion supplement 2011`
    OR p EQUALS `computing the promotion-grade supplement`
    OR p EQUALS `computing another percentage supplement on the combined salary`

#ASSERT `the hours of the Oz week` (`an Oz week of` 24 6 10) EQUALS 40
#ASSERT count (filter `computing a percentage supplement` `what an Oz salary component may count for`) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the school year` 2012 `is from` `the school year 5772` `to` `the school year 5774`
